# Chapter 13, worked example: days between dates, a quarter from a month
do /wgc12~
A1 Invoiced
B1 @DATE(92,4,10)
A2 Paid
B2 @DATE(92,6,30)
A3 Days
B3 +B2-B1
A4 Quarter
B4 @CHOOSE(@INT((@MONTH(B1)-1)/3),"Q1","Q2","Q3","Q4")
A5 Late?
B5 @IF(B3>60,"Late","On time")
do /rfd1b1..b2~
show B1
show B2
show B3
show B4
show B5
